<i>Yes, sir.</i>

1818
01:45:26.333 --> 01:45:27.542
Soldier Waheed Ahmed.

1819
01:45:28.167 --> 01:45:29.167
He was on leave

1820
01:45:29.375 --> 01:45:30.375
for Eid, sir.

1821
