- What do we want?
- Freedom!

1872
01:47:49.792 --> 01:47:51.667
- What is our dream?
- Freedom!

1873
01:47:51.750 --> 01:47:54.375
- What do we wish for?
- Freedom!

1874
01:47:54.458 --> 01:47:56.000
- Shut up!
- Freedom!

1875
01:47:56.292 --> 01:47:57.875
- What do we want?
- Freedom!

1876
01:47:57.958 --> 01:47:58.792
Hey! Shut up!

1877
01:47:58.875 --> 01:48:00.333
- What do we need?
- Freedom!

1878
