1982
01:53:10.250 --> 01:53:11.250
Two down!

1983
01:53:13.042 --> 01:53:14.083
Boys, cover us.

1984
01:53:20.708 --> 01:53:21.708
Got an extra magazine?

1985
01:53:25.250 --> 01:53:26.875
Why did you come here, sir?

1986
01:53:27.208 --> 01:53:28.375
Waheed, you're doing good.

1987
